{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "0728d38a611564de1b7279cb136b0b8dd6c961bc497eeb5c3615b3b4b7ff7340", "ja": "みんなと、一緒に", "zh": "和大家，一起", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "498ebf8e89765bd54639225fdc7f04224abe64a58ef82654278f8596b025e863", "ja": "イベント当日。ステージの直前、プロデュー\nサーに「みんなとマンガを作るのが楽しかっ\nた」と話す翼。ステージでは真からの特別\nメッセージを紹介、3人で描いたマンガ\n『彼氏になってよ。』のネームを披露する。", "zh": "活动当天。在登台前，翼对制作人说，和大家一起创作漫画很开心。舞台上，她介绍了真送来的特别留言，并展示了由3人共同创作的漫画《请做我的男朋友。》的分镜稿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "05893691b016d3565b4a9e30af9ad5d85186c6acfe8de34da16a69eec64b8f7a", "ja": "（みんなの頑張りの結果、遂にネームが完成！　そして\n『りるきゃん』50周年イベントが始まった……）", "zh": "（在大家的努力下，分镜终于完成了！然后，‘小莉露嘉年华’50周年活动开始了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d1d1ba6426acc8e02d2f0e369fc4d7dfdf8e7390b6e31441a160f97a2eef60f3", "ja": "みんな、準備はいいな？\nそれじゃ、ステージ脇に移動して待機だ。", "zh": "大家都准备好了吗？\n那么，移动到舞台旁边待命吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "4730180866e12f594b24c85acd999d5d8893a5b06e680b97ea8645e60c060318", "ja": "はい……！／はーい！", "zh": "好的……！／好——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c3d4cbc863e00301cd5f2f602a66275d4eb667617b772f7a2178f7d6dea16bc3", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}さん。\nちょっといい？", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}先生。\n现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "844844155a1e94b9ef6c28f28f81d899a5646869a50d051c260fb199765eac23", "ja": "お、翼。どうした？", "zh": "哦，翼。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "79a00f431b66bf255695f0656d227e97c215240e9e18fefb7628f5190de60ebd", "ja": "あのね、大したことじゃないんだけど……。", "zh": "那个，其实也不是什么大不了的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cc07902f47c785a4b7a236bf9134cb50650c61fda3c27eed4f81caa1655ea5d1", "ja": "わたし、今までこういうふうに、みんなで\n何かを作るとか、あんまりやったことなくて。", "zh": "我以前很少像这样，和大家一起做些什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c8e783f738a8a6be2870c0c18e48b0493f1eb75696985b942895cadd5af55599", "ja": "今までは、わたしが何かしなくても、\nみんながやってくれたから。", "zh": "以前就算我什么都不做，大家也会帮我做好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1d3da5bd159d7ff1ca113cf6cc2dc79553bf72ade45f383845b40082c3499e12", "ja": "そ、そうか……うん。\nそれで？", "zh": "是、是这样啊……嗯。\n然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7a98239df04de990de85ba9e91f1c278e8e367da526e904c90e58c741d1191a2", "ja": "でもね、なんか今回、みんなとマンガを作るの、\nすっごく楽しかったんですよー。", "zh": "不过啊，这次和大家一起创作漫画，真的特别开心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a8714724bafcdbd54445f1fdaae1821f31381b821530481de07bd6bd1b75a78c", "ja": "……それはよかった。\n物を作るのは大変だけど、楽しいよな。", "zh": "……那挺好的。\n虽然创作东西很辛苦，但确实很有意思啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "43df527027f0b235de5467e20be63a9ffab81ca4728e3a3a3cdaee9300e6d70c", "ja": "翼からそんな感想が聞けて、嬉しいよ。", "zh": "能听到翼这样的感想，我很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "95d6f829b1d0874317a01b107e377de44dc30ba466d14ea918fdab1749e2b4d0", "ja": "えへへ♪　イベントも、みんなと一緒に\n楽しんできますから。ちゃんと見ててくださいね～？", "zh": "嘿嘿♪我会和大家一起好好享受活动的。请一定要看着我哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1f416cf12fd980cbd017713c827faf77442e61c3d1875848f0d8ab5ec8b7d36f", "ja": "ああ、また後でな！", "zh": "啊，待会儿见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e77ea99445cef50379413fb06de3d83422fba8f71aa81e9ae437c024a900ac97", "ja": "（全員でのマンガ作り……思いがけず、\n翼の成長に繋がったのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（大家一起创作漫画……没想到，或许这也促成了翼的成长。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "eac87f40972da0dc3d52e945492689fd9679dfa398292a2b2cab7ad105280248", "ja": "さてと。俺も、翼達に負けないくらい\n今日のイベントを楽しまないと！", "zh": "那么，我也得好好享受今天的活动，不能输给翼她们啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "655e1f0cfa22548d968e6340f516b484b12c6535f6d443164bf52f7719e3ca12", "ja": "（イベントのステージが始まった。\n参加者達で賑わう中、次はついに、3人の出番だ！）", "zh": "（活动的舞台开始了。在热闹的参加者中，终于轮到3人登场了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "905306081f94af0729288a76868131b9506b44b0a847c1dde25a0e0a4d32db5e", "ja": "みなさーん！　こんにちは～！　楽しんでますかー？\n『りるきゃん』のイメージモデル、伊吹翼でーす！", "zh": "大家——！你们好～！玩得开心吗——？\n我是『りるきゃん』的形象模特，伊吹翼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "2c3a5e82ef29384cebcd0a892996bd7e219067bb10184869b5422ee7449999b9", "ja": "お、同じく、篠宮可憐です……！　今日は、この\nイベントに参加できて、とっても、うれしいです……！", "zh": "哦、我、我也是，篠宫可怜……！今天能参加这个活动，我真的非常开心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "aa3c13ea68586ee5ef56de574a34ce4d267405e9846b9c6847848cf3379c5ca1", "ja": "そして！　スーパーアイドル、野々原茜ちゃんだよ！\n茜ちゃんたちのカワイイ姿、最後まで見逃さないでね☆", "zh": "接下来！超级偶像野野原小茜登场啦！可别错过小茜们可爱的身姿，一直看到最后哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1021_sankasya", "source_sha256": "29804ec313346fa7cd59236f151b72b1a1dcdf7b0baf30265fde39201ce6714a", "ja": "ワァアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "22c1ba63b64074bc8e266d3534c014777cbeb3a3b15c32794e0058cc0e6102f0", "ja": "というわけで～、『りるきゃん』50周年、\nおめでとうございまーす！", "zh": "所以说～祝贺『りるきゃん』迎来50周年纪念！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "cf6588810729d62d1cd00939d82967e647b2c8b99f5b35b249383bdd80dbce31", "ja": "ご、50年って、本当にすごいですよね……。\nそれだけ、長く愛されてきたってことだから……。", "zh": "五、50年，真的很了不起呢……。\n这就说明，一直以来都深受大家喜爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4f4dbfeedfc8e1286bb77f9a8d153b77eed234a94d302ee5f8d2cb02e5b811f8", "ja": "うんうん！　わたしのクラスの子たちも、\nみんな『りるきゃん』読んでるんですよ～。", "zh": "嗯嗯！我班上的同学们也都在看《りるきゃん》哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a07d520cdac5b9b3a30579be69c746b1030eaf728508ca29c9b926d0d429e342", "ja": "だから、イメージモデルに選ばれた時は、\nすっごくうれしかったでーす♪", "zh": "所以，被选为形象模特时，我真的特别开心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "56ef87c8e39b31e07f0c6a8774ebd76aa99f442663677dfa105e36ad687c7d10", "ja": "そんな、イメージモデルの茜ちゃん達のステージを\nお見せする前に……何やらメッセージが届いてるとか？", "zh": "在为大家展示这些形象模特小茜们的舞台之前……听说好像收到了一条消息？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "fd676edcdeb8718ace4a6bda004f3186efc2f912f2d36580debad70f1e04a9ef", "ja": "う、うん……。この方から、スペシャルメッセージが\n届いてます……！　ど、どうぞ……！", "zh": "嗯、嗯……这位为我们送来了特别消息……！请、请看……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "a612c708396baa280d12bcb88fb35068fccd89e3ec37b3980394023c8b707d23", "ja": "『りるきゃん』創刊50周年、おめでとうございます！\n『キミに叫ぶよ』紫藤カケルを演じた、菊地真です！", "zh": "祝贺《Lil Can》创刊50周年！\n我是饰演了《对你呐喊》中紫藤翔一角的菊地真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1029_sankasya", "source_sha256": "169f6b0d89018049eafcf96b7f950708d55bc8ee8bac975da0d4e3841e613423", "ja": "キャーーーーーー！！！！", "zh": "呀——————！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "b3450dee46b8f4f8570c6026eae375d368e5e9dd8ee833a12fc560a653c15fac", "ja": "『りるきゃん』って、夢見る乙女の宝物ですよね！\nボクも、たくさんのトキメキをもらいました！", "zh": "“Lil Can”真的是怀揣梦想的少女的宝物呢！\n我也收获了满满的心动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "c5fd7dceabb9f52ad1aff1e20b5ad2771e5eeb4edc580c145186df6b9a135807", "ja": "イベントに参加できなくて残念ですが、\nボクの分も、みなさん思いっきり楽しんでくださいね！", "zh": "没能参加活动，虽然很遗憾，\n但也请大家连同我的份一起尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1032_sankasya", "source_sha256": "169f6b0d89018049eafcf96b7f950708d55bc8ee8bac975da0d4e3841e613423", "ja": "キャーーーーーー！！！！", "zh": "呀——————！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "cd0fc918e68e2a47ae34e6a4bbc70f1c3e10dc02b442a37abc02dc7c5677bdfd", "ja": "そして、最後に！　翼、可憐、茜！　ステージ\nがんばってね、応援してるよ！　以上、菊地真でした！", "zh": "然后，最后！翼、可怜、茜！在舞台上加油哦，我会为你们打气的！以上就是菊地真！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1034_se", "source_sha256": "5bc69e5b1c1ad7ceead171d240a9d31173ed372760ba22fbc0b5aa7947d8d15c", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ……", "zh": "啪啪啪啪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7b7efb7b2875c0b7f4cfc4c75b4863f0c76e8e2087545f129d28c5b43e36f5dd", "ja": "わぁ……♪　真さん、ありがとうございまーす！\nほんとにスペシャルなメッセージでしたね～！", "zh": "哇……♪　真前辈，非常感谢您～！\n真是太特别的一段话了呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1036_023aka", "source_sha256": "d0820235450c2322b020ddabbf5a469a9cf17c62296ba8065da669c1020216e9", "ja": "うんうん！　まこりんにも応援されたことだし、\n茜ちゃんたち、がんばらないとだね！", "zh": "嗯嗯！既然也得到了真琳的鼓励，小茜们也得加油才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1037_045kar", "source_sha256": "20acb499a46a65ce92d955bd885819efeafd2a7d1f8c0a82d19f01ddc5ada9ba", "ja": "そ、そうだね……！　えっと、そ、それじゃあ、\nそろそろ次のコーナーに、行きたいと思います……！", "zh": "对、对的……！那个，那么，我们差不多该进入下一个环节了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "1d5c4859d9dc51cd8c860ee83909c6babdf2ddafbeb07e19229b864b2f0df98f", "ja": "ついに来たね、この時が！　地獄の公開……ゴホゴホ。\n『公開持ち込みコーナー』が！", "zh": "终于到这一刻了！地狱的公开……咳咳。  \n“公开投稿环节”开始了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1039_016tsu", "source_sha256": "baa3a2d75d8012cbd335b069832005a9b291f1f125e277a828efdc46c198dc1b", "ja": "実はわたしたち3人で、マンガを描いてきたんです！\nと言っても、ネーム？ってやつだけなんですけど。", "zh": "其实我们3个人画了漫画带过来哦！\n虽说其实就只有分镜稿？这种东西就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1040_045kar", "source_sha256": "e5e1100c826b7a5cca5122f9e81eccae0482e2169b6bf5c42105ae539add5ebd", "ja": "ぼ、棒人間が描いてあるだけなので……\nちょっと、恥ずかしいね……？", "zh": "因、因为上面只画了几个火柴人……有点难为情呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0866e9545d44749a290f3898ff739ae536c7629514db6443a4a44a854f3e1694", "ja": "最初は3人それぞれに作ろうと思ったんですけど、\nすっごく難しくて。", "zh": "一开始我想着给3个人分别做，\n但是好难好难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1042_045kar", "source_sha256": "a52de700e3c6500c69c7ab3374738bfb4a4aacc2b663839bc48446e71fead823", "ja": "さ……3人のアイディアを、みんなで話し合って、\nひ、ひとつのお話にしました……！", "zh": "呃……3个人的点子，大家一起讨论后，编成了一个、一个故事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1043_023aka", "source_sha256": "39022e52e3ec36f287ce8f3f9d128d53362b95d89b0208f24f33fc3605a35330", "ja": "いろんな人にアドバイスをもらって、\n練りに練った、茜ちゃんたちの自信作だよ♪", "zh": "这是听取了许多人的建议，反复打磨后完成的、小茜们的得意之作哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1044_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d385bbd019cad466fe01bdd8f2759f86b33aa4f2597cbec107b2ea979de6994c", "ja": "作品のタイトルはー……。", "zh": "作品的标题是——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_04_1045_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e4f1fdd7fa89bce06fe418240580aeceb391fc43e0fcd4c2cbfb759136093595", "ja": "『彼氏になってよ。』！", "zh": "『做我的男朋友啦。』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
